cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "Analysis code for: Multi-trait selection defines a plant-architecture ideotype for soybean in the Russian Far East"
abstract: >-
  R code and plot-level data for the analysis of six plant-architecture traits in 63 soybean
  accessions evaluated over three growing seasons (2018-2020) at the Far Eastern Research
  Institute of Agriculture, Khabarovsk Krai, Russia. Covers variance partitioning, genetic
  parameters and genotypic values, leave-one-year-out cross-validation, multivariate
  structure, and multi-trait selection with MGIDI and MTSI.
type: software
